      "source_url": "https://x.com/McDonaldHopkins/status/2082143677992804709",
      "text": "Scammers are getting more sophisticated. The FBI is warning that criminals are now using AI-generated deepfake videos of senior FBI officials to make fraud schemes appear legitimate.\nhttps://www.mcdonaldhopkins.com/insights/news/fbi-renews-warning-on-ai-generated-deepfakes?utm_content=383326845&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter&hss_channel=tw-63105555",
      "author_handle": "McDonaldHopkins",
      "created_at": "2026-07-28T16:38:31Z",
      "has_media": false
    },
    {
      "source_url": "https://x.com/LilyInBloom3/status/2082784079616131521",
      "text": "\"Seeing is believing\" is no more relevant\n▫️Techniques like diffusion models, 3D NeRFs, and zero shot voice cloning have rendered synthetic media indistinguishable from reality. While this unlocks massive creative potential, it presents critical enterprise risks; from executive impersonation to biometric bypass.\n▫️The path forward requires shifting from simple detection to cryptographic media provenance (C2PA).\n🔸Will detection tools ever catch up or are we stuck in a Zero Trust digital environment ❓",
      "author_handle": "LilyInBloom3",
      "created_at": "2026-07-30T11:03:15Z",
      "has_media": false
    },
    {
      "source_url": "https://x.com/CanadaFP/status/2034651759092658295",
      "text": "AI can now mimic a person's face and voice with startling accuracy. Deepfakes can make anyone appear to do or say anything. A familiar face or voice no longer guarantees authenticity.\n\nBe cautious. Check the source.\n\n#ThinkBeforeYouShare",
      "author_handle": "CanadaFP",
      "created_at": "2026-03-19T15:22:36Z",
      "has_media": true
    },
    {
      "source_url": "https://x.com/PoliMarketer/status/2083538238916956669",
      "text": "Deepfake rapid response units are facing algorithmic attacks.\n\nAutomated audio verification is being used to check spectral patterns, voice consistency, AI manipulation, and source reliability.\n\n#DeepfakeDetection #RapidResponse #AudioVerification #CrisisCommunication",
      "author_handle": "PoliMarketer",
      "created_at": "2026-08-01T13:00:01Z",
      "has_media": true
    },
    {
      "source_url": "https://x.com/SenateAging/status/2082551906228912361",
      "text": "The AI Deception Machine: Deepfakes, Chatbots, and the New Frontier of Senior Fraud https://twitter.com/i/broadcasts/1jxXggNErWeJZ",
      "author_handle": "SenateAging",
      "created_at": "2026-07-29T19:40:41Z",
      "has_media": false
    },
    {
      "source_url": "https://x.com/samtilston/status/2082058501980045644",
      "text": "We talk about deepfakes as if they're the frontier of synthetic media\n\nThey're not\n\nSynthetic text at scale — AI-generated comment sections, fake op-eds, manufactured \"expert consensus\" — is already deployed and largely undetected\n\nThe face gets the headlines\n\nThe words do the work",
      "author_handle": "samtilston",
      "created_at": "2026-07-28T11:00:04Z",
      "has_media": false
    },
    {
      "source_url": "https://x.com/bankpolicy/status/2083221876071977226",
      "text": "Reducing online impersonation scams is like a math equation.  \n\nRead how government + banking, social media and telecom industry collaboration = fewer scams.\n\nhttps://bpi.com/impersonation/",
      "author_handle": "bankpolicy",
      "created_at": "2026-07-31T16:02:54Z",
      "has_media": false
    },
    {
      "source_url": "https://x.com/PersonaShield/status/2082844076102001148",
      "text": "TikTok is testing an opt-in deepfake detection tool. Creators verify their identity through Jumio by uploading a government ID and a live selfie, then TikTok scans the platform for AI-generated content matching their face.\n\nOpt-in is a good start, and built-in detection helps the creators using it, especially after Meta's Muse Image showed opt-out sets the wrong default.\n\nThe bigger need is cross-platform protection. A creator protected on TikTok or YouTube can still have their likeness appear elsewhere, and no single platform can watch the wider internet on its own.\n\nVerification is another area still evolving. Uploading an ID to a third party adds friction and a new custodian to trust. Tools like PersonaShield use face-based verification instead, where the likeness itself becomes the credential, keeping the trust closer to the person being protected.\n\nTikTok's tool is a meaningful step, but the next layer is protection that runs across every platform, not just where someone posts.",
      "author_handle": "PersonaShield",
      "created_at": "2026-07-30T15:01:39Z",
      "has_media": false
    },
    {
      "source_url": "https://x.com/DDNewslive/status/2082808938488070249",
      "text": "Government Strengthens Framework to Counter AI-Generated Deepfakes through Legal Safeguards, Platform Accountability and Citizen Protection\n\n13 Responsible AI Projects Approved for Deepfake Detection as Over 11.37 Lakh People Benefit from 6,650 Cyber Security Awareness Workshops\n\nGovernment Enhances User Safety with Faster Removal of Unlawful AI-Generated Content and Strengthened Grievance Redressal Framework\n\nRead Here: https://t.co/wTMeJ4smmV\n\n@GoI_MeitY",
      "author_handle": "DDNewslive",
