      "has_media": true
    },
    {
      "source_url": "https://x.com/simplykashif/status/2082799958860665265",
      "text": "🇮🇳 Indian government is planning a new law that would make \"AI DEEPFAKE\" and \"DIGITAL ARREST\" scams separate criminal offences.\n\nProposal is expected to be discussed during the current parliament session.\n\n-> 12.7 lakh+ cyber fraud complaints reported in January to June 2026\n-> 10,178 crore+ in reported cyber fraud losses in the first half of 2026\n\n- TOI",
      "author_handle": "simplykashif",
      "created_at": "2026-07-30T12:06:21Z",
      "has_media": false
    },
