      "source_url": "https://x.com/chiefofautism/status/2024048736322629745",
      "text": "someone built a tool that puts ANY FACE on your webcam in REAL TIME\n\ncalled DOT - deepfake offensive toolkit, open source, works right now\n\ndot injects a real-time deepfake into your virtual camera\n\nzoom, google meet, teams, any video call app sees the fake face as your real webcam\n\nit ships with multiple deepfake engines (FOMM, SimSwap, SimSwapHQ), you pick the model based on your GPU and how real you need it to look\n\nbuilt by sensity ai for red teams to test if your identity verification actually holds up against deepfakes",
      "author_handle": "chiefofautism",
      "created_at": "2026-02-18T09:09:58Z",
